{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09264","headline":"云阳馆怀谷口 · 韦应物","name":"云阳馆怀谷口","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清泚阶下流，云自谷口源。\n念昔白衣士，结庐在石门。\n道高杳无累，景静得忘言。\n山夕绿阴满，世移清赏存。\n吏役岂遑暇，幽怀复朝昏。\n云泉非所濯，萝月不可援。\n长往遂真性，暂游恨卑喧。\n出身既事世，高躅难等论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}